Subject: Select canonical SDK declarations for original GX material providers
Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

The ten paired programs retain every original method, initialization request,
loop, material state/scroller branch and array operand. Select canonical native
GX/MTX declarations without changing the console source. Use native matrix
handle types for two pointer-valued caches, preserving their original -1
sentinel assignments, comparisons and updates. Guard four previously adapted
local declarations so the complete console projections equal upstream.

This compiler/handle ABI patch does not supply unknown-size arrays. Original
GXSetArray calls retain their Wii operands until the genuine native RLG loader
proves live extent/stride/byte domain. No draw, source lifetime or GPU success
is implied by compiling the complete original render units.

